# IVLA Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to `server/.env` before starting the application:
#   cp .env.example server/.env

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server Network Configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The local port on which the Express backend will listen.
# Client Vite dev server automatically proxies /api requests to this port.
# Optional. Defaults to 3001 if omitted.
PORT=3001

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NVIDIA Cloud Functions / NIM API Key
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API Key for NVIDIA OpenAI-compatible API services (Nemotron vision/text and FLUX.2 image).
# Get your key from: https://build.nvidia.com
# Required for:
#   - Whiteboard region interpretation (Nemotron-3.5-super-vl)
#   - Conceptual explanations (Nemotron-3.5-super-vl)
#   - Custom AI image generation (FLUX.2-klein-4b)
# Optional for:
#   - Whiteboard drawing & canvas manipulation (works offline)
#   - Wikimedia Commons visual discovery (uses free public MediaWiki Action API)
#   - Type-it-instead text fallback with Pollinations image generation
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-your-key-here
